+- What was implemented
+  - Added migration `0068_invoice_snapshots` with tenant-scoped `invoice_snapshots` and `invoice_snapshot_items`.
+  - Added `InvoiceSnapshotRepository` for period close, export snapshot linkage, customer readback, and audited reopen-for-correction.
+  - Close snapshots record plan id/slug/version, entitlement revision, aggregation version, usage-event checksum, adjustment checksum, export status, counter quantity, adjustment quantity, and final quantity.
+  - Reopen marks the previous snapshot `reopened` with a redacted admin audit event; the next close creates a higher `close_version` instead of rewriting prior item quantities.
